{
  "contract": "wave_stream_v1",
  "name": "session_golden",
  "expect": "accept",
  "why": "One conformant session covering everything the golden path depends on: the HELO/HELO_OK handshake and its channel-descriptor negotiation, one SAMPLES batch with monotonic timestamps, the catch-up SYNC boundary, decoded annotations for EVERY protocol targets/canfd_demo.yml captures (CAN incl. an error event, UART incl. a 9-bit char and a status error, I2C with ACK and NACK, SPI MOSI/MISO pairing, JTAG IR shift and TAP state), raw EDGE_EVENTS carrying BOTH a packed batch and legacy words with the absolute anchor_ns that makes them placeable, the loss counters in both provenance flavours (precise in-band and synthesized out-of-band) plus an error_run storm collapse, the edge_maxfreq max-frequency datum of a captured line both measured and as the re-armed null sentinel, a STATS frame with the full counter set including the nulls that mean 'no regbank slot', a DIGEST with a CRITICAL verdict, the CONTROL / CONTROL_ACK back-channel, a RATE_HINT, an UNKNOWN tag that MUST be skipped without ending the session, and a graceful EOF. Annotations carry the HWTX event_id and text_res {long, short}; a long label shows the short resolution clipped to 32 characters, one annotation goes without either key because both are optional, and one event is sent a second time under its own event_id, as a late joiner's keyframe resends it.",
